msgid "Enqueue items into play queue in one instance mode"
msgstr "Mete les elemints al cowe del rote a djouwer e môde ene instance"

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1210
msgid ""
"When using the one instance only option, enqueue items to play queue and "
"keep playing current item."
msgstr ""
"Cwand vos eployîz li tchuze « ene seule instance », mete les elemints al "
"cowe del rote a djouwer et continuwer a djouwer l' elemint d' asteure."

#: src/libvlc-module.c:1223
