#: modules/gui/macosx/windows/VLCAboutWindowController.m:130
#: modules/gui/qt/dialogs/help/help.cpp:98
msgid ""
"<p>VLC media player is a free and open source media player, encoder, and "
"streamer made by the volunteers of the <a href=\"https://www.videolan.org/"
"\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#0057ae;\">VideoLAN</"
"span></a> community.</p><p>VLC uses its internal codecs, works on "
"essentially every popular platform, and can read almost all files, CDs, "
"DVDs, network streams, capture cards and other media formats!</p><p><a "
"href=\"https://www.videolan.org/contribute/\"><span style=\" text-"
"decoration: underline; color:#0057ae;\">Help and join us!</span></a>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Li djouweu d' media VLC est on libe djouweu d' media, ecôdeu et difuzeu "
"di floûs, a côde å lådje, fwait pa les volontaires del cominaute <a "
"href=\"https://www.videolan.org/\"><span style=\" text-decoration: "
"underline; color:#0057ae;\">VideoLAN</span></a>.</p><p>VLC eploye ses prôpes "
"codecs, toûne so cåzu totes les platfômes corantes, et pout lere cåzu tos "
"les fitchîs, CDs, DVDs, floûs pa l' rantoele, cåtes d' egaloyaedje et ôtes "
"cognes di media!</p><p><a href=\"https://www.videolan.org/contribute/"
"\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#0057ae;\">Aidîz nos et "
"vnoz avou nos ôtes!</span></a>"

